msgstr "Adicionar uma pasta"

#: crates/nd-gui/src/pages/devices.rs:295
msgid "Address"
msgstr "Endereço"

#: crates/nd-gui/src/pages/settings.rs:206
msgid ""
"Adds a “BigNetScreen” output. Send that application's sound to it and "
"nothing else leaves this computer"
msgstr ""
"Adiciona uma saída “BigNetScreen”. Envie o som daquele aplicativo para ela e "
"nada mais sai deste computador"

#: crates/nd-gui/src/pages/settings.rs:309
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Avançado"

#: crates/nd-gui/src/pages/mod.rs:187
msgid "AirPlay"
msgstr "AirPlay"

#: crates/nd-gui/src/pages/devices.rs:370
msgid "All protocols"
msgstr "Todos os protocolos"

#: crates/nd-gui/src/app/wording.rs:106
msgid "All system audio"
msgstr "Todo o áudio do sistema"

#: crates/nd-gui/src/pages/home.rs:527
msgid "An extra desktop, just for this"
msgstr "Uma área de trabalho extra, só para isso"

#: crates/nd-gui/src/pages/settings.rs:140
msgid ""
"Aspect ratio is preserved. Miracast uses a supported mode within these "
"limits."
msgstr ""
"A proporção é preservada. O Miracast usa um modo compatível dentro destes "
"limites."

#: crates/nd-gui/src/pages/home.rs:562 crates/nd-gui/src/pages/settings.rs:186
msgid "Audio"
msgstr "Áudio"

#: crates/nd-gui/src/app/dialogs.rs:182
msgid ""
"Authenticate when prompted. Downloading and building the package may take a "
"few minutes. Keep the app open until installation finishes."
msgstr ""
"Autentique-se quando solicitado. O download e a compilação do pacote podem "
"levar alguns minutos. Mantenha o aplicativo aberto até a instalação terminar."

#: crates/nd-gui/src/pages/settings.rs:274
msgid "Automatic"
msgstr "Automático"

#: crates/nd-gui/src/pages/devices.rs:184
#: crates/nd-gui/src/pages/devices.rs:190
#: crates/nd-gui/src/pages/settings.rs:288
msgid "Automatic discovery"
msgstr "Descoberta automática"

#: crates/nd-gui/src/app/wording.rs:25 crates/nd-gui/src/pages/mod.rs:345
msgid "Automatic discovery is off"
msgstr "A descoberta automática está desativada"

#: crates/nd-gui/src/pages/mod.rs:138
msgid "Available"
msgstr "Disponível"

#: crates/nd-gui/src/pages/home.rs:342
msgid "Back"
msgstr "Voltar"

#: crates/nd-gui/src/pages/media/mod.rs:313
#: crates/nd-gui/src/pages/media/mod.rs:895
msgid "Back 10 seconds"
msgstr "Voltar 10 segundos"

#: crates/nd-gui/src/pages/settings.rs:171
msgid "Balanced — the default"
msgstr "Equilibrado — o padrão"

#: crates/nd-gui/src/pages/settings.rs:164
msgid ""
"Buffering smooths uneven playback and delays everything, the pointer "
"included. On Miracast it is applied here; on Chromecast it is a request the "
"receiver may ignore."
msgstr ""
"O buffer suaviza a reprodução irregular e atrasa tudo, inclusive o ponteiro. "
"No Miracast ele é aplicado aqui; no Chromecast é um pedido que o receptor "
"pode ignorar."

#: crates/nd-gui/src/app/dialogs.rs:101 crates/nd-gui/src/pages/devices.rs:471
#: crates/nd-gui/src/pages/settings.rs:481
